'''Theatre of Blood: SM Speed-Chaser''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete an Entry Mode [[Theatre of Blood]] run within 17 minutes, not including time between rooms. This can be completed with any group size.

==Strategy==
Entry mode should prove to be no problem for most players; the only issue will be the [[Nylocas]] room and it is recommended to run a trio so the room can be cleared without much hassle.

